#!/usr/bin/env python3
"""bm-goal — native goal lifecycle CLI (also reachable as `bm goal <verb>`).

Durable goal records live under $XDG_STATE_HOME/beastmode/goals. See
schema/goal-lifecycle.json for states, transitions, exit codes and the
harness capability matrix; references/goal-lifecycle.md for the operator guide.
"""

